# ResilienceOps AI — copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
# Google AI Studio key (https://aistudio.google.com) — the agents run on Gemini through Google ADK.
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# Model: leave as is (gemini-3.8-flash). If Google retires it, the backend switches to the model Google's error names.
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
